          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Contact {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Whole-person care, integrative medicine, educational intake and supportive follow-up.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg1:#0f1724; --bg2:#06202a; --accent:#ffb578; --muted:#cbd5e1; --card:#0b1220; --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);\\n      --radius:16px; --maxw:1100px; --gap:28px; --accent-2:#8be5c7;\\n      font-family:Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;\\n    }\\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg1),var(--bg2));color:var(--muted);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}\\n    .wrap{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:34px auto;padding:28px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 460px;gap:var(--gap);align-items:start}\\n\\n    /* Split diagonal hero column */\\n    .left{\\n      position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:var(--radius);min-height:560px;color:white;padding:44px 44px 60px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#06292f 5%, rgba(6,41,47,0.65) 45%, rgba(13,27,44,0.85) 100%);\\n      box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.6), inset 0 -80px 100px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);\\n      clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 12%, 100% 100%, 0% 100%);\\n    }\\n    .left::before{\\n      content:\\\"\\\";position:absolute;right:-120px;top:-60px;width:520px;height:520px;opacity:0.14;filter:blur(18px);\\n      background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, var(--accent), transparent 35%), radial-gradient(circle at 70% 70%, var(--accent-2), transparent 30%);\\n      transform:rotate(18deg);\\n    }\\n    header.nav{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:6px}\\n    header.nav a{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.76);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;font-size:13px}\\n    header.nav a:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04)}\\n\\n    h1{font-size:38px;margin:12px 0 6px;line-height:1.05;color:#fff}\\n    .kicker{color:var(--accent-2);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.6px;margin-bottom:8px}\\n    p.lead{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);max-width:58ch;font-size:15px;margin:0 0 20px}\\n\\n    .contact-card{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .chip{background:var(--glass);padding:12px;border-radius:12px;backdrop-filter:blur(6px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n    .chip strong{display:block;color:#fff}\\n    .pill{display:inline-block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n\\n    /* Right column - form + details */\\n    .right{position:relative}\\n    form.contact{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.03), rgba(255,255,255,0.01));padding:22px;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04)}\\n    label{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px}\\n    input[type=text],input[type=email],textarea,select{width:100%;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);background:transparent;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px}\\n    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}\\n    .row{display:flex;gap:10px}\\n    .btn-primary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#ffc89a);color:#0a0a0a;font-weight:700;border:none;margin-top:12px;cursor:pointer}\\n    .btn-ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);color:var(--muted);padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px}\\n\\n    /* Myth vs Truth / accordion */\\n    .accordion{margin-top:20px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.01), transparent);border-radius:12px;padding:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n    .acc-item{padding:12px;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:8px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.01));}\\n    .acc-item h4{margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#fff}\\n    .acc-item p{margin:6px 0 0;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    /* Pillars & case notes */\\n    .pillars{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .pillar{flex:1;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), rgba(255,255,255,0.01));border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n    .pillar h5{margin:0 0 6px;color:#fff}\\n    .case{margin-top:18px;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);border:1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n    .case p{margin:8px 0;font-size:14px}\\n\\n    /* FAQ & CTA */\\n    .faq{margin-top:18px}\\n    .faq h3{color:#fff;margin-bottom:8px}\\n    .faq-item{padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.015);margin-bottom:8px}\\n    .footer-cta{margin-top:20px;padding:18px;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,186,120,0.06), rgba(139,229,199,0.02));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\\n\\n    small.mono{font-size:12px;color:#9fb4c3}\\n    @media (max-width:980px){\\n      .wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:18px}\\n      .left{min-height:520px}\\n      .right{order:2}\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <section class=\\\"left\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"contact-hero\\\">\\n      <nav class=\\\"nav\\\" aria-label=\\\"primary\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">What We Do</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"conditions.html\\\">Concerns</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">How We Work</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">Our Story</a>\\n      </nav>\\n\\n      <div>\\n        <div class=\\\"kicker\\\">Meet Whole-Person Care</div>\\n        <h1 id=\\\"contact-hero\\\">Connect with {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Guided support, practical plans</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">An intensive integrative approach that centers education, lifestyle strategies, and collaborative planning. We never promise cures — just expert guidance tailored to your unique body, history, and goals.</p>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"contact-card\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"chip\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"pill\\\">Phone</span>\\n            <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong>\\n            <small class=\\\"mono\\\">Mon–Fri, by appointment</small>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"chip\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"pill\\\">Email</span>\\n            <strong>{{EMAIL}}</strong>\\n            <small class=\\\"mono\\\">We aim to reply within 2 business days</small>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"pillars\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"false\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"pillar\\\">\\n            <h5>Rooted Assessment</h5>\\n            <p>Comprehensive intake that honors history, labs (optional), and life context — we map patterns, not just symptoms.</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"pillar\\\">\\n            <h5>Personalized Plan</h5>\\n            <p>Nutrition, movement, targeted supplements, stress tools, and educational goals you can keep up with.</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"pillar\\\">\\n            <h5>Ongoing Support</h5>\\n            <p>Follow-ups, adjustments, and measurable milestones so small wins add up to real change.</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"case\\\">\\n          <strong>Case Snapshot</strong>\\n          <p>Client: mid-40s, chronic sleep disruption and low energy. Approach: lifestyle reset + targeted sleep hygiene + optional labs to rule out thyroid and iron differences. Outcome: improved daytime energy and clearer sleep patterns over 12 weeks (individual results vary).</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"accordion\\\" aria-label=\\\"myths and truths\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"acc-item\\\">\\n            <h4>Myth — Natural means no side effects</h4>\\n            <p>Truth: Botanicals and supplements can interact with medications. We educate on safe, evidence-informed choices.</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"acc-item\\\">\\n            <h4>Myth — Holistic care is vague</h4>\\n            <p>Truth: Our plans include measurable goals, timelines, and practical homework — we blend warmth with structure.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <!-- subtle decorative svg pattern embedded for visual richness -->\\n      <svg width=\\\"0\\\" height=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"position:absolute;left:-1px;top:-1px;opacity:0\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n        <defs>\\n          <pattern id=\\\"diag-grid\\\" width=\\\"40\\\" height=\\\"40\\\" patternUnits=\\\"userSpaceOnUse\\\" patternTransform=\\\"rotate(18)\\\">\\n            <rect width=\\\"40\\\" height=\\\"40\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\"></rect>\\n            <path d=\\\"M0 0 L0 40\\\" stroke=\\\"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1\\\"/>\\n            <path d=\\\"M0 0 L40 0\\\" stroke=\\\"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1\\\"/>\\n          </pattern>\\n        </defs>\\n      </svg>\\n\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <aside class=\\\"right\\\">\\n      <form class=\\\"contact\\\" action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"form-title\\\">\\n        <h3 id=\\\"form-title\\\" style=\\\"color:#fff;margin:0 0 6px\\\">Reach Out & Book</h3>\\n        <p style=\\\"margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Tell us a bit about what brings you here. For urgent concerns, call {{PHONE}}.</p>\\n\\n        <label for=\\\"name\\\">Full name</label>\\n        <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your name\\\" required>\\n\\n        <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label>\\n        <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@example.com\\\" required>\\n\\n        <label for=\\\"phone\\\">Phone (optional)</label>\\n        <input id=\\\"phone\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"(555) 555-5555\\\">\\n\\n        <label for=\\\"concern\\\">Primary concern</label>\\n        <select id=\\\"concern\\\" name=\\\"concern\\\">\\n          <option>Sleep & Recovery</option>\\n          <option>Stress & Mood</option>\\n          <option>Digestion & Gut Health</option>\\n          <option>Inflammation & Pain</option>\\n          <option>Energy & Metabolism</option>\\n          <option>Other / General</option>\\n        </select>\\n\\n        <label for=\\\"message\\\">Short note</label>\\n        <textarea id=\\\"message\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"A few sentences about history, recent labs (if any), and goals\\\"></textarea>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-end\\\">\\n          <button class=\\\"btn-ghost\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" onclick=\\\"location.href='book.html'\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>\\n          <button class=\\\"btn-primary\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Send & Request Visit</button>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <small class=\\\"mono\\\" style=\\\"display:block;margin-top:10px\\\">By submitting you agree to our intake process. We maintain privacy and do not offer medical guarantees.</small>\\n      </form>\\n\\n      <section class=\\\"faq\\\" aria-label=\\\"faq\\\">\\n        <h3>Quick Questions</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"faq-item\\\">\\n          <strong>Do you accept insurance?</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--muted)\\\">We provide superbills and work with some plans; always confirm with your provider. Some packages are private-pay.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"faq-item\\\">\\n          <strong>Will I need lab tests?</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--muted)\\\">Optional labs can be useful for clarity. We discuss what is necessary and evidence-based during intake.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"faq-item\\\">\\n          <strong>How quickly will I see changes?</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--muted)\\\">Every person progresses differently. We set realistic milestones and adjust the plan collaboratively.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"footer-cta\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <strong style=\\\"color:#fff\\\">Ready for an intensive, guided plan?</strong>\\n          <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">Book a focused intake with {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n          <a class=\\\"btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Book Now</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n    </aside>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <footer style=\\\"text-align:center;padding:24px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">\\n    <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n    <div style=\\\"margin-top:6px\\\">© <span id=\\\"year\\\"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — education-forward integrative care</div>\\n  </footer>\\n\\n  <script>\\n    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();\\n  </script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"# Contact Page — holistic_medicine (chunk 4)\\n\\nThis bundle contains the contact page (contact.html) for the holistic/integrative medicine website and a README describing usage.\\n\\nFiles included:\\n- contact.html — self-contained contact and information page for {{BUSINESS_NAME}}. Contains hero, myth_vs_truth, pillars, case_notes, faq, and cta sections as required.\\n- README.md — this file.\\n\\nNotes & integration\\n- The page is intentionally self-contained: CSS, SVG pattern, and layout are embedded inline and do not require external assets.\\n- Replace placeholders in the HTML where appropriate: {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}, {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}.\\n- Content is written to emphasize education and whole-person care; avoid promising cures. This page follows the \\\"intensive\\\" offer model: a focused intake and follow-up process.\\n- Navigation links point to the other pages in the site (index.html, services.html, conditions.html, approach.html, pricing.html, about.html, book.html, contact.html).\\n\\nAccessibility & behavior\\n- Forms use semantic labels and have reasonable contrast. The contact form posts to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}; you may wire this to your booking backend or mailing system.\\n- The FAQ, myth_vs_truth, and other content are static; if you want interactive accordions, add small JS enhancements.\\n\\nVisual assets\\n- A decorative SVG pattern is embedded inline for reliability. If you prefer a shared file, create assets/img/pattern.svg and adapt the CSS to reference it.\\n\\nLegal & clinical guidance\\n- This content avoids guarantees and focuses on educational recommendations and supportive care. For any medical/legal copy changes, consult your compliance reviewer.\\n\\nIf you need alternate tone variants, translated content, or a lightweight JS accordion enhancement, ask and I can provide updates.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
